flowchart TB
  %% Payment-sync engine — orchestration flow of PaymentSyncService.
  %% Source of truth: src/member_memberships/service/payment_sync/ (sync-guide skill).
  %% Shape B: the sync steps live in one box; Supabase + Stripe are external actors
  %% OUTSIDE it, with the external edges drawn at the box level (same convention as
  %% architecture.mermaid). Which step touches which system is named in the step text.
  %% Green = engine steps / entry points. Orange = external actors. Solid = live runtime
  %% call / control-flow sequence. Dashed = future or shared-code annotation.

  triggers["🔔 Triggers — lifecycle callers<br/>start · cancel · price swap · apply / remove discounts · link<br/>explicit freeze / unfreeze → PaymentSyncFreeze directly<br/>plan reprice fan-out → bulk"]

  subgraph engine["⚙️ PaymentSyncService — the sync engine"]
    direction TB
    entry["update_payments_recurring(member_id, key, pay_first_invoice_out_of_band)<br/>the real sync — re-derive DB-desired state, converge Stripe<br/>NO add_ids / cancel_ids — desired state is the DB read"]
    s1["1 · resolve parent + gym account<br/>BillingParentResolver.resolve — follow account_linked_to_id once"]
    s2["2 · maintenance freeze re-apply (PaymentSyncFreeze)<br/>converge pause_collection to parent.is_frozen (DB freeze window)<br/>before any item change · billing order matters · no DB write here"]
    s3["3 · finalize once discounts (PaymentSyncOnceDiscounts)<br/>pre-sync DB settle — read live coupon ids, set-math the consumed<br/>batch-stamp end_date so convergence drops them by date"]
    s4["4 · build desired bucket — pure read (no writes)<br/>family ids · active recurring (cancel_date IS NULL) · snapshots<br/>consolidate_by_price → one IntervalBucket"]
    s5["5 · compute + attach coupons<br/>plan_line_discounts per line: drop past-end_date · aggregate per mode<br/>percent summed then / quantity, dollar summed<br/>find-or-create deterministic coupon · write coupon_id back on snapshots"]
    s6["6 · execute_sync (PaymentSyncStripe)<br/>create | update | cancel the monthly subscription<br/>proration = always_invoice if any item prorates, else none<br/>keys: sub_create / sub_update / sub_cancel"]
    s7["7 · write sub id back + price writeback (never raises)<br/>update_profile_sub_ids → parent members row (None if cancelled)<br/>read upcoming invoice → fan per-plan + parent monthly totals"]
    ret["return PaymentsSubscriptionResponse<br/>(None when bucket is empty → subscription cancelled)"]

    preview["preview_update_payments_recurring(member_id) — dry run<br/>resolve + same build as step 4, then preview_execute_sync<br/>NO settle · NO coupons · NO writeback · nothing changes"]
    bulk["bulk_payment_sync(member_ids)<br/>loop members · fresh uuid4 key each · DB-derived<br/>swallow per-member errors and continue"]
    reconciler["⏳ deferred scheduled reconciler — NOT built<br/>sweep idle members on a clock · reuses the settle + resolver<br/>mid-cycle end_date enforcement + once finalization<br/>Stripe → CRM outcome absorption (dunning cancels)"]

    entry --> s1
    s1 --> s2
    s2 --> s3
    s3 --> s4
    s4 --> s5
    s5 --> s6
    s6 --> s7
    s7 --> ret
    bulk --> entry
    preview -.->|"resolve + build (step 4)"| s4
    reconciler -.->|"seeds the sweep (future)"| bulk
  end

  supabase["🗄️ Supabase — service-role, unfiltered base tables<br/>resolve_parent · get_family_ids · get_active_recurring<br/>get_applied_discounts_by_member · get_unconsumed_once_discounts<br/>set_snapshot_coupon_id · mark_once_consumed<br/>update_profile_sub_ids · sync_prices_by_plan · sync_profile_monthly_total"]
  stripe["💳 Stripe — gym Connect account<br/>get_subscription (read live discounts, once-settle)<br/>create / update / cancel subscription · pause_collection<br/>coupons (find-or-create) · upcoming invoice"]

  triggers -->|"mutations → update / preview · plan reprice → bulk"| engine
  engine -->|"read/write: parent · family · memberships · snapshots · once-candidates · coupon_id · sub id · totals"| supabase
  engine -->|"live discounts · find-or-create coupons · create / update / cancel sub · pause_collection · upcoming invoice"| stripe

  classDef svc fill:#e6f7ec,stroke:#2f8f53,color:#0c3a1f;
  classDef ext fill:#ffd9a8,stroke:#d2691e,color:#4a2c08;
  classDef future fill:#e6f7ec,stroke:#2f8f53,color:#0c3a1f,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
  class triggers,entry,s1,s2,s3,s4,s5,s6,s7,ret,preview,bulk svc;
  class supabase,stripe ext;
  class reconciler future;
  style engine fill:#f4f9f6,stroke:#2f8f53;
